  "executive_briefing": "As of late June 2026, the crypto-financial landscape is dominated by the Senate Banking Committee's 15-9 vote to advance the Clarity Act, signaling a transition from theoretical debate to concrete regulatory implementation. This legislative milestone is fundamentally reshaping the competitive landscape, creating a bridge for 'Programmable Bitcoin' that challenges the EVM's long-standing dominance in smart-contract utility. Simultaneously, Ethereum is undergoing an intense structural transition characterized by the formation of Ethlabs and significant organizational restructuring, while institutional interest in Bitcoin is pivoting from passive ETF exposure to proactive integration within global treasury management. The DeFi sector is responding to this maturation by shifting away from centralized wrapped assets toward native, non-custodial interoperability solutions.",
